  "notes": "Study play. Our LD recovers behind the net and goes up the left wall to our LW. I'm the weak-side winger. Hold the right hash marks until the puck is on its way up the far wall, then leave for the middle lane at the blue line. The LW's second pass finds me in the middle with speed, and I carry it out and in. Their F2 on my wall is late because I left when the puck moved, not before.",
  "captions": [
    {
      "t_ms": 0,
      "text": "Our LD recovers behind the net on the far side. I'm stopped at the hash marks on my wall. Their LW sits on me."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 1500,
      "text": "LD goes up the far wall to our LW. I hold. Leave now and their F2 follows me into the middle."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 2500,
      "text": "The puck is on the far wall, moving up. Now I go: middle lane at the blue line."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 3000,
      "text": "Our LW is under pressure on the wall and moves it to the middle. I'm in the lane with speed."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 4000,
      "text": "Puck arrives in the middle. Carry; C beside me, LW behind."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 4800,
      "text": "Zone exit, support on both sides."
    },
    {
      "t_ms": 6500,
      "text": "Zone entry at the far blue line. It's a rush."
    }
  ]
